# Every Dockerfile builds from the repo root (pnpm workspace), so keep the
# context small and never ship local secrets or build output into an image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.expo
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.idea
.vscode
**/.impeccable
**/coverage
**/*.log
apps/mobile/ios
apps/mobile/android
